    "cliExample": "management-interface GigabitEthernet0/0 allow ssh https\n! Isole la gestion sur une interface hors-bande dédiée",
    "hint": "Management Plane = Administration (SSH/SNMP) ; Control Plane = Protocoles de routage (OSPF/BGP)."
